  "plain_english": "Rudra created the celestial nymphs for the sake of Kauśika's pleasure.",
  "sanskrit_cite": "sasarjāpsaraso rudraḥ kauśika prītikāraṇāt",
  "l0_ids": [
   "mukta-m0-p262-v6547-p000"
